ng/planning/journal.jsonl`: 670 KB over 251 events against 166 KB of artifacts\n  (`114c2340` audit `wc -c`) — every `update` carries the whole body.\n- `114c2340#32`: harness exempts the journal from `check-no-home-paths.py` (`:85-86`) because \"editing\n  either to satisfy this check would forge the record\"; `97e74f6d#39` ran `sed -i` over the journal anyway.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- An `update` event carries `body_digest` and a unified diff against the previous revision; `history`\n  and `explain` render the diff; `validate` recomputes the digest chain.\n- `body`, `new --from` and `set` refuse a body or field containing `/home/<user>/` or `$HOME` unless\n  `--allow-home-path` is given, and the refusal names the line.\n- Existing journals with full bodies stay readable; `validate` reports how many events predate the digest form.\n\n## Out of Scope\n\nRewriting existing journals.\n","relations":[{"decomposes":"epic:evidence-gated-completion"},{"serves":"vision:O2"}],"scope":[{"confidence":"cited","path":"crates/edge/aep-cli"},{"confidence":"inferred","path":"crates/govern/aep-domain"},{"confidence":"cited","path":"crates/plan/aep-backend-markdown"}],"status":"draft","summary":"harness journal is 670 KB over 251 events for 166 KB of artifacts; an absolute path journalled is permanent and got sed -i'd.","tags":["store"],"title":"The journal records a body by digest and diff, and refuses a home directory"},"lifecycle_state":"draft"},"relations":[{"decomposes":"epic:evidence-gated-completion"},{"serves":"vision:O2"}],"scope":[{"confidence":"cited","path":"crates/edge/aep-cli"},{"confidence":"inferred","path":"crates/govern/aep-domain"},{"confidence":"cited","path":"crates/plan/aep-backend-markdown"}],"summary":"harness journal is 670 KB over 251 events for 166 KB of artifacts; an absolute path journalled is permanent and got sed -i'd.","tags":["store"],"title":"The journal records a body by digest and diff, and refuses a home directory"},"id":"ent-8bda05b24c41395a3e1b863